        │    JAVA       │
        └───────┬───────┘
                │
      ┌─────────┼─────────┐
      ↓         ↓         ↓
Portability  Simplicity  Security
      │         │         │
 Bytecode    No explicit  JVM-based
 + JVM       pointers     security
      │       + GC
      ↓
    WORA
```

### One-Line Summary

> **Java was designed to provide portability through bytecode and JVM, simplicity through a managed and cleaner language design, and security through controlled execution within the JVM.**
